# UCOMISS -- override: the manual's 'RESULT := OrderedCompare(...)' / CASE on the
# result sets ZF, PF, CF (unordered 111, greater 000, less 001, equal 100) and
# clears OF, SF, AF; CompareFlags(a, b, signaling) is that one FP compare
# (UCOMIS: only an SNaN raises invalid).
@operation
tmp := CompareFlags(DEST[31:0], SRC[31:0], 0);
